License:   MIT -- see altoclef/LICENSE

This copy is a fork tracking Minecraft 26.1.2 / Fabric / Java 25.

Modifications made for burtcraft:

  ADDED    src/main/java/adris/altoclef/external/ExternalControlServer.java
           A localhost-only, newline-delimited-JSON TCP server (default port
           7440) that exposes AltoClef's command executor and live game state
           to an out-of-process controller. Registered as an ADDITIVE Fabric
           "client" entrypoint in fabric.mod.json; it modifies no existing
           AltoClef class. Also draws the optional on-screen intent HUD and
           owns the F1 manual-control toggle.

  ADDED    src/main/java/adris/altoclef/commands/PlaceCommand.java
           `@place <block>`, backed by PlaceBlockNearbyTask.

  ADDED    src/main/java/adris/altoclef/mixins/KeyboardInputLockMixin.java
           src/main/java/adris/altoclef/mixins/MouseInputLockMixin.java
           Suppress physical keyboard/mouse input while the bot is driving, so
           a human at the same machine cannot fight the bot for control. F1
           releases the lock.

  ADDED    src/main/java/adris/altoclef/mixins/MixinLocalPlayer.java
           src/main/java/adris/altoclef/mixins/ClientUIMixin.java
           Camera view-angle hooks (smoothed look / auto third-person) and HUD
           stack handling.

  MODIFIED src/main/java/adris/altoclef/commandsystem/CommandExecutor.java
           Added a public getMod() accessor so the control server can read the
           live task chain (used for the "what am I doing right now" readout).

  MODIFIED src/main/java/adris/altoclef/Settings.java
           `showTaskChains` now defaults to false. Upstream's task-tree dump is
           an unreadable spew over a live stream, and a regenerated settings
           file used to silently bring it back.

  MODIFIED src/main/resources/fabric.mod.json
           Registered the "client" entrypoint above; bumped the Minecraft /
           Java / Fabric Loader dependency floors for 26.1.2.

  MODIFIED build.gradle, gradle.properties, settings.gradle
           Retarget to Minecraft 26.1.2 (which ships unobfuscated, so there are
           no Yarn mappings and Loom has no remapJar task -- `jar` is already
           the shippable artifact). Baritone is jar-in-jar'd into the AltoClef
           jar so only one jar is ever deployed.


